Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:03:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Let /gloss open an empty reader and pick the PDF in the
 browser

- PDF argument is optional; annotations then go to ~/.gloss-reader/annotations.json
- Save PDF uses a browser download when the file was opened in the browser

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017W17acTezG7Tit8VVLsCdB
